Z||000000||FieroBUZZ||04-08-2001||10:34 AM||||I will be pulling my motor for a clutch and  either refreshing the 2.8 or going to a 3.1.  I use my licence for work so don't speed (hehe). However, I do like some lower oomph when you need it, cruising done at about 65 MPH.  I have available both the M19 (4:10) and M17 (3.65) trans.  Any thoughts on which to use for the best all round effect.    Thanks.<BR>Gary<BR>"A day without a buzz is a day that never wuzz"||||reg||12
